DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20060629T113000
SUMMARY:VC Visit to ICS
DESCRIPTION:We have booked E7BT3 at 11.30am for this meeting. All staff 
 in the Division are encouraged to make the time and join this meeting. T
 he proposed format is as follows:\n\n11.30am V-C arrives at Division Off
 ice to meet Dean and HoDs\n11.35am V-C\, Dean and HoDs arrive E7BT3\n\nO
 ur new Dean\, Stephen Thurgate will be chair the meeting. \n\nPaul Smith
  will introduce Stephen Thurgate to the Division.\n\nPresentation by Ste
 phen Thurgate\, 10 min\nPresentation by Mark Wardle\, Director of Resear
 ch 5 min\nPresentation by Dom Verity\, Director PPDP 5 min\n\nStephen Th
 urgate will intro the new V-C Steven Schwartz who will give a short 10 m
 inute presentation.\n\nQuestions from the floor - 30 minutes\n\n12.30pm 
 Tea and coffee will be available in E6A302 for staff to mingle with the 
 new Dean and V-C.
END:VEVENT
