DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20070426T160000
SUMMARY:Math Meeting
DESCRIPTION:The committee comprising Rod Yager\, Ross Street and myself\
 nhas been considering what offerings units could possibly be rested in 2
 008 (and beyond as appropriate).\n \n A number of 100\, 200 and 300 leve
 l units were considered. After much discussion of the impact that restin
 g of various units would have on various programs\, the following two of
 ferings emerged as possible\ncandidates to rest:\nMATH235 semester 2\nMA
 TH237 semester 2\n \nWe will have a meeting on Thursday 26th April at 4 
 pm in E7A333 to\ndiscuss the matter. 
END:VEVENT
