DURATION:PT1H
LOCATION:E6A 133
DTSTAMP:20071003T001435Z
UID:4DCA187B-8CE9-4AA0-912C-23645E4AA2BA
SEQUENCE:4
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20071008T110000
SUMMARY:Colloquium
DESCRIPTION:	\nMathematics Colloquium\n\nDay: Monday 8 October 2007\n\nT
 ime: 1 pm\n\nPlace: E6A133\n\nSpeaker: Professor Michael Cowling\n      
         UNSW\n\nTitle:  Regularity of Quasiconformal Mappings\n\nAbstrac
 t:  Loosely speaking\, the definition of a quasiconformal mapping is tha
 t the image of a small disc is nearly a disc.  It turns out that quasico
 nformal mappings have differentiability properties.  This talk discusses
  how geometry can be turned into smoothness.\n\n\n----------------------
 --------------------------------------------------\nWe will take the spe
 aker out to lunch at the Staff Club.  The lunch party departs from level
  4 of E7A at noon.  Please join us.\n
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
LOCATION:Staff Club & E6A131
