UID:1871A9D7-E900-4444-8CAF-A50FE79F616E
SEQUENCE:6
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20080310T120000
SUMMARY:Colloquium plus lunch
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20080310T140000
DESCRIPTION:Monday 10 March 2008\n\nat 1pm\n\nin E6A131\nSpeaker:  Prof 
 Michael Cwikel\nTechnion -- Israel Institute of Technology\,\n\nTitle: C
 omplex interpolation of compact operators. Creeping towards an answer? 
END:VEVENT
