DESCRIPTION:Just to let you all know that E6A102 has been booked for the
  Scholarships & Prizes function\, Tuesday 22 April 2.30pm-5pm. \n\nElect
 ronic Engineering are providing the guest speaker this year. \n\nAll det
 ails relating to this event will be handled by ICS Student Services.\n\n
 You are warmly welcome and encouraged to attend the Division Information
 \nCommunication Science Prize & Scholarship Ceremony on Tuesday 22 April
  2008.\n\nThis year not only will we be congratulating our prize & Schol
 arship winners but also welcoming 2 Macquarie Merit Scholars\, 1 Higher 
 Study Scholarship and 6 Innovation Award Prizes for Science Communicatio
 n.\n\nThe ceremony will be held in E6A102 starting at 2:30pm sharp follo
 wed by light refreshments.\n\nCould you please for catering RSVP by Wedn
 esday 16 April 2008 to Mayuko Bock on enquiries@ics.mq.edu.au or x 9500.
 \n\nLook forward to seeing you there!
END:VEVENT
