BEGIN:VEVENT
LOCATION:Eastern Ave Auditorium\, University of Sydney
DTSTAMP:20070619T063048Z
UID:5E6AB8D5-54E2-42B7-B8E7-884A790D998A
SEQUENCE:13
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20070720T120000
SUMMARY:TALENTED STUDENTS' DAY
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20070720T140000
DESCRIPTION:Talk at noon\n\nLunch at 1pm\n\nPark in Shepherd St Car Park
 \n\nThe Mathematical Association of New South Wales\, Inc.\n\nKent Road 
 Public School                                              PO Box 339\, 
 North Ryde NSW 1670\nKent Road\, Eastwood NSW  2122                     
           Tel. (02) 9878 1487  Fax (02) 9878 1675\nwww.mansw.nsw.edu.au	
 	e-mail: office@mansw.nsw.edu.au\n\n\nMANSW— promoting quality Mathemati
 cs Education for all\n\n\nTALENTED STUDENTS' DAY \nUNIVERSITY OF SYDNEY\
 nFRIDAY\, 20 JULY\, 2007\n\nLECTURER'S INFORMATION SHEET\n\nName:    Pro
 f  Ross Street\n\nInstitution:   Macquarie University \n\nDepartment / S
 chool:   Mathematics\n\nPhone:          9850 8921     (w)         Fax:  
   9850 8114\n\n          ____________________(h)          Email: street@
 math.mq.edu.au\n\nTitle of talk: Ploughing fields\, permutations\, trees
 \, and the tangent function \n\n________________________________________
 ______________________\n\nShort synopsis:\n\nWhen you read a book you st
 art reading each row from the same end. However\, when you plough a fiel
 d\, you start the new row where you finished the last row. Both methods 
 can be used to produce sequences of numbers. We will look at one such se
 quence that is related to counting permutations\, to counting certain ki
 nds of trees\, and to calculating values of the function tan x . \n\nSes
 sion preferred: Please number 1 and 2 in order of choice\, or NA if unav
 ailable.\n\nSession A:  10.30 to 11.30 am  2          Session B:  12.00 
 to 1.00 pm   1\n\nAny special requirements? (eg. audio visual\, min/max 
 group size etc.): \nThis year we will contact you to confirm these.\n\nB
 lack\, green or white board plus overhead transparency projector.\n\n___
 ___________________________________________________________\n\nPLEASE RE
 TURN THIS SHEET TO YOUR CONTACT PERSON\, OR DIRECTLY TO THE MANSW OFFICE
 \, BY FRIDAY 22 APRIL 2007\n
END:VEVENT
