SUMMARY:Category Seminar
DESCRIPTION:The next meeting of the Australian Category Seminar will tak
 e place at Macquarie University on Wednesday 27th of February  2008\, in
  the seminar room E7A 333.\n\nOne talk:\n\n-----------------------------
 -------------------------------------------------------\nAt 2:05pm\n\nSp
 eaker:  Isar Stubbe (University of Antwerp)\n\nTitle:  \"Locally princip
 ally generated Q-modules\"\n\nAbstract:  After recalling last week's tot
 ally algebraic cocomplete Q-categories\, I shall move on to describe \"o
 rdered sheaves on a quantaloid Q\" in terms of Q-modules (meaning Sup-va
 lued contravariant presheaves on Q).\n\n\n------------------------------
 ------------------------------------------------------\nWe will have lun
 ch in the Macquarie Staff Club. We leave from E7A Level 3 at 12.45 pm.\n
 
END:VEVENT
