 n 1975 he became the foundation professor of Environmental Studies at Ma
 cquarie University where he is an Adjunct Professor.  He is now Chairman
  of the new Sydney Institute of Marine Science.\n\nDr Talbot will discus
 s some of the work being done on Sydney Harbour...an example of a world 
 wide problem of increasing size of coastal cities and their impacts on s
 heltered waters.   And of the problem of coastal sea surface temperature
