DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20070420
SUMMARY:Library Catalogue
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20070421
DESCRIPTION:This message was sent by Glenys Oxlee\, Manager\, Informatio
 n Resources\, Library\nand authorised by Professor Sachs\, Deputy Vice-C
 hancellor (Provost)\n\nFrom approx midnight Thursday 19th and through mo
 st of Friday 20th April the\nLibrary's Voyager system will be being move
 d from its current aged server to\na new server. While this is happening
  the Library Catalogue will be\nunavailable. Note: online renewals and h
 olds will cease from approx noon on\nThursday.\n\n\nThe Journal Finder a
 nd Databases links from the Library Homepage will\ncontinue to work duri
 ng the downtime\, but the data will be 'frozen' at\nThursday 19th April.
 \n
END:VEVENT
