BEGIN:VEVENT
LOCATION:Air
DTSTAMP:20070211T235202Z
UID:6EF9B44C-9A71-4669-8695-BDE126B6F5D4
SEQUENCE:5
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20070424
SUMMARY:David Oury leaves Portland
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20070425
DESCRIPTION:My condolences on the passing of Max Kelly. I know people we
 re very fond of him and that he will be missed greatly. \n\nI have excha
 nged several emails with Viviana Bong at the HDRU and everything seems t
 o be settled.  A short note from ThiThi Aung of the Office of the Deputy
  Vice Chancellor also indicates that my enrolment date is fine with him 
 too. \n\nI applied for a student visa after receiving the Confirmation o
 f Enrolment form. The Immigration department emailed me to say that the 
 visa will be finalised after I send in the documents for the medical exa
 m. \n\nFortunately\, I also found and purchased an affordable ticket to 
 Sydney leaving Portland on April 24th. Preparations for getting the cond
 o rented are coming along too. \n\nAll this is just to keep you up to da
 te. I hope all is well with you. 
END:VEVENT
