END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DURATION:P1D
LOCATION:Global
DTSTAMP:20080429T054606Z
UID:27959EC9-7292-4C81-9540-1F81D27C61D6
SEQUENCE:6
RECURRENCE-ID;VALUE=DATE:20080513
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20080513
SUMMARY:Oscar's birthday
DESCRIPTION:Oscar's the man\nHello friends and family of Oscar\,  \n \nO
 scar will be celebrating his third birthday at his favourite place – THE
  ZOO!!  And you \nare invited to join him. \n \n  \n \nLions      Elepha
 nts \n \nIt’s on Tuesday 13th May.  You can either meet us at the bird’s
  pond near the entrance at \n9.30am\, OR catch up with us for the “party
  bit” (i.e. cake cutting)\, which will be in the \npicnic area near Back
 yard to Bush\, at 11am.   \n \nAlternatively\,  please call my mobile (0
 416 808 517) and I’ll tell you where we are. \n \nHere is a map. \n \n \
 n \nThe picnic area is at 33Q\, just opposite Treetops café (useful for
  those requiring coffee)\, \nand up a bit from Backyard to Bush. \n \nOb
 viously this is a party that works best for stay-at-home mums\, retirees
 \, zoo friend \nmembers\, people with no objection to caged animals\, an
 d a dedicated father who is \nwilling to take the morning off work.  If 
 you fit this description and can make it\, that \nwould be lovely. \n \n
 I’m trusting we are getting all the rain over with now\, but if it persi
 sts the party will be at \nour house. Please let me know if you are plan
 ning to come so I can call if needed with wet \nweather details. \n \nCh
 eers\, \nAnna\, Arthur Oscar and Sam \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n
  \n \n 
END:VEVENT
