SUMMARY:Moyal Lecture
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20061104T090000
DESCRIPTION:The 2006 Moyal Medal presentation and lecture will be held o
 n Friday 3 November 7-9pm in E7BT2. This year the medal is awarded for o
 utstanding contributions to Statistics.\n \nThe Medallist is Professor E
 ugene Senata from the Department of Mathematics and Statistics at Sydney
  University. The Medal will be presented at 7pm\, after which Prof Senet
 a will give the 2006 Moyal Lecture.\n \nHis lecture is entitled\, MARKOV
  CHAINS AS MODELS IN STATISTICAL MECHANICS.
END:VEVENT
