SUMMARY:Indigenous Art Exhibition 
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20060629T200000
DESCRIPTION:The Alumni Office would like to remind you about the very sp
 ecial Indigenous Art Exhibition coming up on Thursday 29 June 2006. \n\n
 This unique alumni event will be presented by Emeritus Professor Di Yerb
 ury\, curator of the Macquarie University Art Gallery. \n\nEmeritus Prof
 essor Yerbury's presentation will be followed by a guided tour of signif
 icant Aboriginal artworks displayed in the upper floor of the Art Galler
 y building.\n\nFor more details\, please go to:\n\nhttp://www.mq.edu.au/
 alumni/html/events.html#29_06_06\n\nTo book on line\, please go to:\n\nh
 ttp://www.mq.edu.au/alumni/html/FormBooking.php\n\nLight refreshments wi
 ll be served at this free alumni event\, however bookings are essential.
 \n\n
END:VEVENT
