SUMMARY:Party
DESCRIPTION:You are invited (with partners\, children and friends) to an
  end of year get together at our house\n\n56 Cheltenham road\, Cheltenha
 m\n\non\n\nWednesday 20th of December (after the seminar if its on)\n\na
