BEGIN:VEVENT
DURATION:PT1H
LOCATION:E7B 263
DTSTAMP:20060807T040116Z
UID:B9727EF9-24A7-4783-9954-22C444491A85
SEQUENCE:6
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20060814T130000
SUMMARY:Math Colloquium
DESCRIPTION:MATHEMATICS COLLOQUIUM\n\nDATE: Monday 14 August 2006\n\nTIM
 E:  1 pm\n\nPLACE: E7B 263\n\nSPEAKER:  William Chen (Macquarie Universi
 ty)\n\nTITLE:  Deterministic and probabilistic discrepancies\n\nABSTRACT
 :  This is joint work with Beck and Travaglini. We compare deterministic
  and probabilistic techniques in the study of upper bounds in problems r
 elated to some mean squares discrepancy with respect to balls in the d-d
 imensional unit torus\, and show that the quality of these techniques de
 pend on an intricate way to the dimension d under consideration.\n
END:VEVENT
