  and would like to\ninvite you to a 'Town Hall' meeting on Friday 23 Jun
 e at 12.00pm in\nthe SAM Atrium.\n\nAt the meeting\, I will:\n\n1. Prese
 nt the survey results\n\n2. Suggest actions to address issues raised in 
 the survey\; and\n\n3. Update you more generally on latest strategic ini
 tiatives\n\nSteven Schwartz
