SUMMARY:Division Meeting
DESCRIPTION:To be held Thursday 10 May 2007 at 1.00pm in E7BT4\n\nAGENDA
 \n\n\n1.	Apologies\nDominic Verity\, Leszek Maciaszek\, Rein Vesilo\n\n\
 n2.	The Department of Electronics has resolved that it should change it’
 s name to:  Department of Electronic Engineering\n\nThe primary reason f
 or this change is to enhance the visibility of the department's engineer
 ing activities to the wider community.  The new name is also a better de
 scription of the research and teaching activity of the department.  Note
  that this is simply a name change and does not preempt or come with any
  structural changes.\n\n\nThe Motion: that the Department of Electronics
  change its name to Department of Electronic Engineering.\n\n
END:VEVENT
