UID:C66C84D2-310F-44D5-AB46-EDEF0F107CA3
SEQUENCE:7
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20071109T190000
SUMMARY:Moyal Medal & Lecture
DESCRIPTION:The 2007 Moyal Lecture will be held on Friday 9 November at 
 7pm in a lecture room to be\narranged.\n\nIt will be given by  the 2007 
 Moyal Medallist\, Professor Peter Drummond of the University\nof Queensl
 and. Professor Drummond is being recognized for his contributions to phy
 sics.\nThe Lecture will include a discussion of the quasi-probability di
 stribution functions in quantum\nmechanics\, in particular the positive 
 P representation which is related to Joe Moyal's phase space\napproach\,
  as well as some of their many applications.\n\nProfessor Drummond is a 
 Fellow of the Australian Academy of Science\, the Australian\nInstitute 
 of Physics and the American Physical Society. He was awarded the Massey\
 nMedal of AIP/IOP in 2004.\n\nThe lecture will follow the presentation o
 f the Medal at 7.00pm. There will be a supper\,\ndrinks and time for dis
 cussion after the lecture.\n\nFor more information please contact me or 
 Christine Hale in the Mathematics Department.
END:VEVENT
