SUMMARY:Director of AMSI
DESCRIPTION:Phil Broadbridge\,  Director of AMSI (Australian Mathematica
 l Sciences Institute) will be visiting the Department on 14th August.\n\
 nHe will be giving a presentation on the activities and benefits that ou
 r AMSI institutional membership brings at 1 pm - 2 pm in E6A 202.\n\nSom
 e members of the department have benefited from AMSI support\nto attend 
 various conferences\, workshops and other activities\; also\nwe are bene
 fiting from the construction of the Access Grid Room facility funded thr
 ough AMSI.\n\nPlease attend this presentation if at all possible. It wil
 l help us maximise the benefits of our continued membership of AMSI.\n
END:VEVENT
