DTSTAMP:20070822T002830Z
DESCRIPTION:Subject: 7 September Public Holiday -  Reminder\n\n\nThis me
 ssage was sent and authorised by Tim Sprague Director of Human Resources
 \n\nThis is a reminder to all Staff that the NSW Government has announce
 d a\npublic holiday to coincide with the Asia-Pacific Economic Co-operat
 ion\n(APEC) Summit on Friday 7 September 2007.  As a result\, 7 Septembe
 r 2007 is\na declared public holiday for Macquarie University staff.\n\n
 The University will still need to maintain essential services such as\nS
 ecurity and Information Technology.  Managers/ supervisors in these area
 s\nare encouraged to discuss local arrangements with affected Staff Memb
 ers. \nAny Staff Member who is required to work on a public holiday will
  be paid at\nthe appropriate rate or provided the opportunity to take an
  alternative day\noff in lieu.\n\nPlease contact Employee Relations staf
 f in HR with any queries regarding the\nabove.\n\nAgain\, I hope you enj
 oy the extra day off.\n\nTim Sprague\n
END:VEVENT
