  by Kylie Colvin and approved by Professor Steven Schwartz\, Vice-Chance
 llor.\n\nThe first Town Hall Meeting for 2008 will be held on Tuesday 12
  February at 1pm in the Atrium\, U@MQ Building.\n\nPaul Bowler and the S
 ustainability Team will talk about Macquarie's sustainable future and a 
 short address will be given by Professor Tim Flannery.\n\nThe Town Hall 
 Meeting is also an opportunity to ask questions of the University Execut
 ive Team about the initiatives planned for 2008.\n\n
