UID:4A22692F-94CC-47F2-8076-050137305149
SEQUENCE:4
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20070903T130000
SUMMARY:Mathematics Colloquium
DESCRIPTION:Day: Monday 3 September 2007\n\nTime:  1 pm \n\nPlace: E6A13
 1 \n\n\nSpeaker: Alexander Chervov \n  (Institute for Theoretical and Ex
 perimental Physics\, Moscow)\n\nTitle:  Geometric Langlands corresponden
 ce and integrable systems\n\nAbstract: We will give brief introduction t
 o the Langlands correspondence.The main topic will be new simple  and ex
 plicit construction of the part of the geometric version of the correspo
 ndence over the field of complex numbers which is based on the ideas fro
 m the integrable systems and quantization theories. If time permits the 
 applications to integrable systems and Lie algebras will be presented.\n
 \n----------------------------\nWe will take the speaker out to lunch at
  the Staff Club.  The lunch party departs from level 4 of E7A at noon.  
 Please join us. \n
END:VEVENT
