BEGIN:VEVENT
DURATION:PT1H
LOCATION:E5A118
DTSTAMP:20070412T070304Z
UID:B3B6BA6A-A907-4CBF-9B81-4E62545CB160
SEQUENCE:6
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20070416T120000
SUMMARY:Colloquium
DESCRIPTION:Mathematics Colloquium - Macquarie University\n\n\nWhen:    
    Monday 16 April 2007 at 1pm\n\nWhere:      E5A118\n\nSpeaker:   Laure
 nt Habsieger\n                 Camille Jordan Institut\, University of L
 yon. \n\n\nTitle: Combinatorial problems\, Krwatchouk polynomials and di
 ophantine equations \n\nAbstract: we discuss several combinatorial probl
 ems\, from graph theory to coding theory.  Answers to these problems are
  expressed in terms of integer zeroes of Krawtchouk polynomials\, provid
 ing various diophantine equations. We study these equations and present 
 some related conjectures. \n\n------------------------------------------
 ------------------------------ \nWe will take the speaker out to lunch a
 t the Staff Club.  The lunch party departs from level 4 of E7A at noon. 
  Please join us. \n
END:VEVENT
