  our new\nUnion Collective Agreement and the $1000 sign on bonus\, which
  will be\npaid to all staff next week.\n\nThe BBQ is on Wednesday 13 Sep
 tember from 12 - 2pm on the Eastern side of the Central Courtyard.\n\nCo
