DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20080212T140000
SUMMARY:Isar arrives
DESCRIPTION:On 04/02/2008\, at 8:41 PM\, Isar Stubbe wrote:\n\nHi Alexei
 \, Steve\, Ross and Richard\,\n\nI'm counting down the days: next week a
 round this time I should be in an airplane heading for Sydney! I'm sched
 uled to arrive on Tuesday 12/02 in the early evening\, so we'll probably
  meet at the category seminar on Wednesday. I'll stay for 8 weeks at Mac
 quarie\, staying in an apartment of the Dunmore Lang College. Mélanie\, 
 my girlfriend\, will join me mid-March for the last three weeks of my st
 ay. I'm looking forward to meeting you\, and the other Sydney-based cate
 gorists and friends\, again!\n\nMany greetings\, and 'till soon\,\n\nIsa
 r.\n
END:VEVENT
