UID:C27B13AD-6CD2-4EF4-B1AF-3560B116CBEA
SEQUENCE:6
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20070402
SUMMARY:Jens Hornsgaard
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20070416
DESCRIPTION:Dear category-guys (and Victoria)\n\nHope everythiing is wel
 l in Sydney and Macquarie University.\n\nAfter I left Sydney I had an ex
 cellent stay in New Zealand and\nreturned home to finish studies at my h
 igh school. Now I have got an\nexcellent permanent position in Copenhage
 n which really pleases me.\n\nCopenhagen is known to be a really expensi
 ve city to live in but I\nwrote the math scholarship to ask them where a
 ll their money came\nfrom. And they invest in cheap flats in Copenhagen 
 and now I live in\none of them and feel quite rich.\n\nSo I have decided
  to spend some money on a trip to Sydney and see how\nthings go and meet
  old friends. I will arrive Monday 2nd April next\nyear and leave Sunday
  the 15th April. The last days I will probably\nplay a chess tournament 
 in Parramatta.\n\nI could be nice to see you all again and remember old 
 days. Sydney\nreally made a huge impression on me. A dinner or something
  could be\nnice. Do you have seminars in Easter?\n\nHope to see you all 
 again soon.\n\nBest wishes\,\nJens\n
END:VEVENT
